Combined distribution licensing
===============================

The original R package mlr is distributed under the BSD 2-Clause license;
its original LICENSE file and DESCRIPTION are included as LICENSE.upstream and
DESCRIPTION.upstream.

This source distribution also includes survival-fortran-v0.1.0, derived from
the R survival package and licensed GPL-2.0-or-later (with individual source
SPDX notices where applicable). Because the Fortran mlr library links to that
dependency, this combined distribution is provided under GPL-2.0-or-later,
while the original mlr-derived files retain their BSD terms.

